ard.":"歡迎來到您的旅行日記！點擊突出顯示的方塊，然後輸入任意字母。字母透過鍵盤輸入。","Now solve this clue to finish the word: {number} {dir} — “{clue}”. Wrong letters can be retyped or cleared.":"現在解決這個線索來完成單字：{number} {dir} —「{clue}」。錯誤的字母可以重新輸入或清除。","Words cross! Letters you placed are shared with the crossing words. Complete any other word using those crossings.":"字交叉！您放置的字母與交叉單字共用。使用這些交叉點完成任何其他單字。","Not sure about a letter? Use Check (C) to confirm correct letters and flag wrong ones. Checking costs a few points.":"不確定是否有一封信？使用檢查 (C) 確認正確的字母並標記錯誤的字母。檢查要花幾個點。","Really stuck? Reveal (H) writes one letter for you, at a small score cost.":"真的卡住了嗎？ Reveal (H) 會以很小的分數成本為您寫一封信。","Finish the page: fill every remaining square with the right letter.":"完成頁面：用正確的字母填滿每個剩餘的方塊。","Learn — First Page":"學習 — 第一頁","Interactive lessons: one rule at a time. ~3 minutes.":"互動課程：一次一條規則。 〜3分鐘。","Tutorial · unranked":"教程·未排名","40 authored pages across five regions; mastery every eighth page.":"40 個手工設計的頁面，橫跨五個區域；每第八頁為精通關卡。","Progress saved locally":"進度已儲存於本機","One shared grid per UTC day, synchronized to server time. ~5–15 minutes.":"每個 UTC 日一個共用網格，與伺服器時間同步。 〜5–15 分鐘。","Ranked leaderboard":"排名排行榜","Practice":"練習","Fresh grid at your chosen difficulty. Restart freely.":"您選擇的難度的新鮮網格。自由重啟。","Casual · unranked":"休閒 · 無排名","Challenges":"挑戰","Constrained goals: time limits, few checks, big grids.":"受限目標：時間限制、少量檢查、大型網格。","Ranked · bonus multiplier":"排名·獎金倍數","{n} of 3 stars":"3 顆星中的 {n} 顆","Unlocked through page {n} of 40":"透過第40頁{n}解鎖","← All modes":"← 所有模式","Finish the previous page to unlock.":"完成上一頁即可解鎖。","{pattern}, difficulty {n}":"{pattern}，難度{n}","Ranked · ×{n} points":"排名·×{n}積分","Practice — {difficulty}":"練習 — {difficulty}","Small 5×5 pages, common words.":"小5×5頁，常用字。","6–7 wide pages, moderate words.":"6–7 個寬頁面，中等詞彙量。","Big 7–9 wide pages, tricky words.":"大型 7–9 寬頁面，棘手單字。","Casual · unranked · restart anytime":"休閒 · 無排名 · 可隨時重開","Page {n} of 40 · {stars}★":"第40頁{n}·{stars}★","{date} · ranked":"{date}·排名","Harbor Dawn":"